   "in": 0.0,
   "out": 3.3,
   "line": "Keeping your parent's house isn't how you honor them."
  },
  {
   "beat": "payload",
   "in": 4.1,
   "out": 9.3,
   "line": "Fourth trip this month. For a house nobody lives in. The closet's still full."
  },
  {
   "beat": "OPEN B",
   "in": 10.1,
   "out": 16.8,
   "line": "And the question you're scared to ask: am I getting ripped off because I just want it gone?"
  },
  {
   "beat": "payload",
   "in": 17.6,
   "out": 21.7,
   "line": "Your sibling won't pay for repairs, and won't take an offer."
  },
  {
   "beat": "OPEN C",
   "in": 22.5,
   "out": 27.3,
   "line": "Here's the honest part: a cash offer is lower than a listed sale."
  },
  {
   "beat": "payload",
   "in": 28.1,
   "out": 34.7,
   "line": "A listed sale means repairs, a clean-out, showings, and months of taxes while it sits. Four hours away."
  },
  {
   "beat": "CLOSE C",
   "in": 35.5,
   "out": 42.9,
   "line": "That's why the lower number can still leave you with more: no repairs, no clean-out, no more months of taxes."
  },
